{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d29a01f4df1eff6b1e4f98d26560ad0b632d932825248fed79e0f735a3f7243b", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の連載は好評だ。\n今日はロコの撮影で、テーマは『日常』らしいが……）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的连载广受好评。今天要拍摄的是ROCO，主题似乎是『日常』，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "f69b4ae42f17b1fb95cd4ecfabc45960a941679bdfd952ae7d4aa94aa2e46b40", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n突然ですけど、これを受け取ってください。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n虽然有点突然，但请收下这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fed4db33a4d3a946a15bf48ff7acef29681aaee14c5a583ddf58fe3be55c3e02", "ja": "これは……折り紙みたいに見えるけど、なんだ？", "zh": "这看起来像是折纸，不过是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "5fb1ff70e29821c6db266770f8ba537350ec0829cea2b258c44100d5647c0352", "ja": "これはレターペーパーをロコナイズした、\nアトラクティブなレターです♪", "zh": "这是将信纸ROCO化后的吸睛信件♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "bc7b4c9286ecfc8a2a3be4f779b5e5460ced6a9fa0348dccce2a42eb6bc16fd1", "ja": "今日のフォトグラフィーのテーマが『エブリディ』って\n聞いたので、クラスメイトを観察してみたんです。", "zh": "听说今天摄影的主题是『Everyday』，所以我试着观察了一下同班同学。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "98b468f394f39ce0c2676992edc94146b0b97d7e9b4dea3b0c99333bd69ebfab", "ja": "そしたら、授業中にメモを回している子がいたので……\nロコもマネしてみたんですよ。どうですか！？", "zh": "结果，我发现有个孩子在上课时传纸条……所以ROCO也试着模仿了一下。怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1006_p", "source_sha256": "50a280f3ce06eba14911aeb3515ca2e11fed89ab5b0213f773aca60304b8d92a", "ja": "なるほど、手紙だったのか。……っていうか、\n授業中に手紙なんか回しちゃダメじゃないか。", "zh": "原来是信啊。……话说回来，\n上课时不可以传信吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "680bb262c1e3e01c9675996b6a71661a46bd48c7b1dfa9804445c0f6e1d5dc57", "ja": "えっ！？　……ろ、ロコはやってませんよ！\nクラスメイトがやっていたのを、見てただけです！", "zh": "诶！？……洛、ROCO才没做那种事呢！\n我只是看到同班同学在传，才看了一下而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "4c5f705be37f48b56eedcffd386d97bba6de5cbe21733cbf59295fa78e28a000", "ja": "それに、ロコの友達はハトくらい……\nあ、な、なんでもないです！", "zh": "而且，ROCO的朋友也就只有鸽子之类的……啊，没、没什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8c8c2f59c38ccdd592939cf62a79c05a6c5ca37ad1e770020362f42acc1cabb8", "ja": "そ、そうか。とにかく、授業中によそ見はダメだぞ。\n……ところでこれ、どうやって開けばいいんだ？", "zh": "是、是吗。总之，上课时可不能东张西望。\n……话说回来，这个要怎么打开啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "172ec85224ee10ce89a900ddca6899f279f05848179e8adbfc639bde7bd922aa", "ja": "あれ？\n{$P$}、開けられませんか？", "zh": "咦？\n{$P$}打不开吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d966039cf180b2c1e6517454b3ad9f55b5fde31bc4e73cf7f6955781c2894426", "ja": "そうだな、だいぶ複雑に折ってあるから……\n無理に開けようとすると、紙が破れそうだ。", "zh": "是啊，毕竟折得相当复杂……\n要是硬拆的话，纸好像会破。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "a2435bf581a027ed84c9ed5be3060946c0a3fe70b783a6a0ea5917a1ea06f625", "ja": "そんなぁ！？\nせっかく、マーベラスなハトが折れたのに～！", "zh": "怎么会这样！？  \n好不容易才折出了这么棒的鸽子～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "30a6e013700436df4043f128b7b5dc4118173452b4088becbf9571dca4a03f67", "ja": "でも中身が読めないと、レターになりませんし……\nうう、どうしたらいいんでしょう～！", "zh": "可是，要是读不到里面的内容，就不能算是信了……\n\n呜呜，到底该怎么办才好呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1014_p", "source_sha256": "be0c78f1ba58b09c1777b2ab5ba2fb1c56cfe909868e4af920e7eff5ed64754b", "ja": "う～ん、そうだな。紙の内側じゃなくて、\n外側に手紙を書く……のは、ダメか。", "zh": "嗯～，说得也是。要不不写在纸的里面，\n而是写在外面……不行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "8d56844ed7103b42d4d8870ca3a5837f52e80cf51355dbd4b2ade086b4404368", "ja": "そんなのダメですよ！　レターに書いてあることは、\nトップシークレットなんですから！", "zh": "那样可不行！信上写的内容可是最高机密，绝对不能让人知道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "4786d13ad6de94da060bb57e9cf6c3ef96b61630b96a512ed890e70ef874b157", "ja": "だから、内側に隠さなくちゃダメです。\n開けて内容を読むのが、エモーショナルなんですよ！", "zh": "所以，必须藏在里面才行。\n打开后阅读内容，这才够有情感嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1017_p", "source_sha256": "94f3c871af414c2fb1307ffe5ae66e42dad9d90e3ebf860d73486c8d8a81198d", "ja": "なるほど……確かにそうかもしれないな。\nじゃあこの手紙も、エモーショナルな内容なのか？", "zh": "原来如此……确实有可能。\n那这封信的内容也很令人感动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "13f91d6b7dbf229959506399ee72b441539a819e6ae63511bf792cf38c00aa06", "ja": "あっ、それは……！\nええと、別に大したことは書いてありません～！", "zh": "啊，那是……！\n那个，其实没写什么大不了的内容～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0133_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "4b195ee88e8bfad5d7c2ffbfe0f71e660aa74c594a89c115d433c71131899cd3", "ja": "{$P$}、やっぱりレターを開くのは\n後にしてください！　{$P$}……！", "zh": "{$P$}，果然还是请您晚点再打开信件！{$P$}……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
